WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
I'm in a courtroom, cold and gray

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:10.000
She's on the left side, across the way

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.500
Her lawyer's spinning twisted lies

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.408
About the "boy" he's "incapacitated"

00:00:18.868 --> 00:00:24.000
A "captive" who's been "manipulated"

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.500
But then my shark begins to rise...

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.000
She stands and speaks, her voice is clear

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.593
"Your Honor, there's no captive here"

00:00:35.794 --> 00:00:38.500
"He's a competent adult"

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.872
"With a four point oh result!"

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.500
DEAN'S LIST! A transcript in her hand!

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.000
SELF-ADVOCACY! He took a stand!

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.500
A wall of facts, a wall of proof

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:56.000
It's tearing off her broken roof!

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.500
And in the back, my family

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.500
Sixteen strong, all here for me

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.800
This isn't a fight, it's a release

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:06.600
She has no case!

00:01:06.686 --> 00:01:10.288
The judge's eyes, they turn to me

00:01:10.368 --> 00:01:13.000
"Son, do you feel you are not free?"

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.500
I look at her, my voice is strong

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.231
"I'm safer than I've ever been"

00:01:17.271 --> 00:01:20.500
"This is the only family"

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:23.934
"That I have ever known or seen!"

00:01:23.974 --> 00:01:26.500
DEAN'S LIST! A transcript in her hand!

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:29.500
SELF-ADVOCACY! He took a stand!

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:32.000
A wall of facts, a wall of proof

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.579
It's tearing off her broken roof!

00:01:35.599 --> 00:01:40.000
"This is not a case of incapacity."

00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:05.222
"This is a parent who can't let go."

00:02:08.583 --> 00:02:10.963
"This petition is a waste of this court's time!"

00:02:12.864 --> 00:02:15.364
"You are dangerously close to legal harassment."

00:02:16.304 --> 00:02:19.645
"Dismissed! With prejudice!"

00:02:19.645 --> 00:02:36.330
[Triumphant Guitar & Piano Solo]

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:40.172
DEAN'S LIST! A transcript in her hand!

00:02:40.212 --> 00:02:44.234
SELF-ADVOCACY! He took a stand!

00:02:44.654 --> 00:02:46.800
A wall of facts, a wall of proof

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:48.776
It's tearing off her broken roof!

00:02:49.017 --> 00:02:51.000
And in the back, my family

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.139
Sixteen strong, all here for me

00:02:53.319 --> 00:02:58.500
This isn't a fight, it's a release

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:04.725
She has no case!

00:03:09.418 --> 00:03:14.864
Dismissed!

00:03:15.064 --> 00:03:19.228
Dismissed!

00:03:19.609 --> 00:03:26.720
With prejudice!
